Repository controls
===================

Terraform owns the repository settings, Actions allowlist, Dependabot security
updates, and the ``main`` ruleset.

Apply
-----

Set ``GITHUB_TOKEN`` to a token with repository administration access, then::

   terraform -chdir=iac/github init
   terraform -chdir=iac/github plan
   terraform -chdir=iac/github apply

GitHub's Terraform provider does not expose public-fork workflow approval.
Reconcile that setting once after repository creation::

   gh api --method PUT \
     repos/windsornguyen/ComplexityTheory/actions/permissions/fork-pr-contributor-approval \
     -f approval_policy=all_external_contributors
